<title>USA: Patriot raises $210 million in offering.</title>
<headline>Patriot raises $210 million in offering.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patriot American Hospitality Inc and Patriot American Hospitality Operating Co said Tuesday they raised about $210 million in a 9.2 million share offering priced at $24 a share.</p>
<p>Shares in the two companies, which trade as a single unit, hit a new high of 24-1/8 Tuesday morning under heavy volume: 1.97 million shares changed hands, making it the sixth most heavily-traded stock on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
